<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Rental cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Rental cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it downgraded U.S. Rentals Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said stock has approached the 12-month target price of $28-1/2.</p>
<p>-- said still attracted to the stock on the basis of its long-term earnings per share growth of &quot;20 percent plus&quot; and its potential to exceed earnings expectations.</p>
<p>-- still expects U.S. Rental to post earnings growth of 26 percent in 1997 and 20 percent in 1998.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Rental lost 1-7/8 to 25-5/8.</p>
</text>
